# Normalize line endings to LF in the working tree so tools like gofmt and git
# agree regardless of platform or core.autocrlf. Git already stores these files
# as LF; this makes Windows checkouts match instead of converting to CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary